{#
  One media cell's inner content — the caller wraps this in a
  .groups-media-cell (position:relative, sized by its own grid). `media`
  is a Modules\Gallery\Api\DelegatedMedia. `sizes` is the caller's
  description of how wide that cell actually draws, in CSS `sizes`
  syntax — see the srcset note below; it defaults to the widest case a
  cell ever reaches, so a caller that forgets it gets a sharp image
  rather than a blurry one.

  Never a broken image: 'pending'/'processing' shows a spinner, 'failed'
  a discreet notice, and only 'done' actually renders the thumbnail —
  matching modules/gallery's own album grid (album.html.twig).
#}
{% if media.processingStatus == 'done' %}
    {#
      A PHOTO is offered in two renditions rather than one (issue #330).
      The 300px thumbnail gallery produces (Service\ImageProcessingService
      ::THUMB_LONG_SIDE) is right for an album's own grid, where a cell is
      a third to a sixth of the screen — and far too small here, where one
      photo in a message fills the phone's width (up to 420px on a
      desktop, components.css) on a screen drawing 2 to 3 physical pixels
      per CSS pixel. That stretch is exactly the blur the issue reported.
      So the browser is given the 1200px 'medium' as well — the same
      rendition the lightbox already opens, so no new size to produce and
      nothing to re-process for the photos already online — and picks
      between them from `sizes` and the screen's own density.

      The descriptors are the renditions' LONG sides, which is the width
      of a landscape photo and an over-estimate for a portrait one: both
      candidates are over-stated by the same factor, so the choice between
      them is unaffected, and the only effect is at the boundary where the
      thumbnail is just wide enough.

      A VIDEO gets no srcset: its 'medium' and 'large' are MP4 files
      (Task\ProcessVideoHandler), never images, and its 'thumb' is an
      unscaled frame of the video itself — already sharp.
    #}
    <img src="/gallery/media/{{ media.id }}/thumb"
         {% if media.mediaType != 'video' %}
             srcset="/gallery/media/{{ media.id }}/thumb 300w, /gallery/media/{{ media.id }}/medium 1200w"
             sizes="{{ sizes|default('100vw') }}"
         {% endif %}
         alt="" class="w-100 h-100" style="object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy">
    {% if media.mediaType == 'video' %}
        <span class="position-absolute top-50 start-50 translate-middle text-white" style="font-size:1.75rem;text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,.6);">
            <i class="bi bi-play-circle-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </span>
    {% endif %}
{% elseif media.processingStatus == 'failed' %}
    <span class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100 text-danger" title="Échec du traitement de ce média">
        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </span>
{% else %}
    <span class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center h-100 text-body-secondary" title="Traitement en cours">
        <span class="spinner-border spinner-border-sm"></span>
    </span>
{% endif %}
